Package: avlm
Title: Safe Anytime Valid Inference for Linear Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Michael",
                  family = "Lindon",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "michael.s.lindon@gmail.com")
Description: Implements the anytime valid methodology for linear models documented in "Anytime-Valid Inference in Linear Models with Applications to Regression-Adjusted Causal Inference" <doi:10.1080/01621459.2026.2692052>, and its cluster-robust extension documented in "Anytime-Valid Inference in Linear Models with Clustered Outcomes: Exact Multivariate Tests and Cluster-Robust Confidence Sequences" <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2610.25613>.
